*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# Ch. 34: shell scripts run inside Linux containers -- CRLF (which
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check out as, on Windows) breaks the
# #!/bin/sh shebang and any `set -eu`/parameter-expansion line under a
# Linux shell. Force LF regardless of the cloning platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
